flowchart TD
    Intake[Diff Intake] --> Triager{Triager Gate}
    Triager -->|SKIP| Skipped[Skipped: force-proceed available]
    Triager -->|PROCEED / forced| Scout[Scout: scope + entry point]
    Scout -->|unscopable| Degraded1[Graceful Degradation]
    Scout --> DeltaAnalyst[Delta Analyst: thesis + spec draft]
    DeltaAnalyst --> HarnessEngineer[Harness Engineer: dual harness]
    HarnessEngineer -->|"attempt 1-3, escalating strategy"| FidelityVerifier[Fidelity Verifier: Symmetrist + Assayer]
    FidelityVerifier -->|"Loop A: Symmetrist FAIL or agreement < 0.85"| HarnessEngineer
    FidelityVerifier -->|"attempts exhausted or low confidence band"| Degraded2[Graceful Degradation]
    FidelityVerifier -->|verified| Adversary[Adversary: divergence search]
    Adversary -->|"Loop B: max D < epsilon, 1 kickback"| DeltaAnalyst
    Adversary -->|"kickback exhausted"| Inert[Inert Result: behaviorally inert]
    Adversary -->|"spec complete"| Synthesizer[Synthesizer: mechanical render]
    Synthesizer --> Widget[Playable Microworld]
